PF2e Flatten - unofficial v14 test candidate

Derived from PF2e Flatten V0.6.2, upstream commit
14bf3571b3717f5dbe76f81206382a9fdb7dfc3f:
https://github.com/League-of-Foundry-Developers/pf2e-flatten/

The upstream source states that it modifies the original PF2e Toolbox module.
The upstream README credits DJphoenix719 and the PF2e Toolbox NPC Flattening
function:
https://github.com/Djphoenix719/FVTT-PF2EToolbox/releases

