the license or imply endorsement by either upstream project.

Modified 2026-10-11: bundle.js (v14 directory integration and write guards),
module.json (unofficial candidate identity, compatibility bounds and candidate
installation/update URLs), and README.md (current behavior and limitations).
New CHANGELOG.md, PUBLICATION.md, test fixtures and packaging script document
and validate this independently modified candidate. LICENSE and lang/en.json
are unchanged from upstream.
